   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_koopa_07",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]ワガハイは もっと\nりりしい[Ruby 目;め]を しているぞ！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#9",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_koopa_08",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]なんだ！\n[0002:0000:14 00][Ruby 石像;せきぞう]が [Ruby 動;うご]き[Ruby 出;だ]したぞ！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#10",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_koopa_20",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]…[0002:0000:14 00]そういえば\nノドが かわいたな。[0002:0001:]"
