  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#39",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_koopa_16",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:][0001:0001:][Ruby 相手;あいて]に なってやるわ！！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#40",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_gerapato_01",
   "style": 10,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:0A 00][0001:0004:][0001:0001:][0005:0000:]ふるるるるる！！"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#41",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_gerapato_02",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]その[Ruby 石像;せきぞう]には ワレが[Ruby 少;すこ]しばかり\n[Ruby 手;て]を [Ruby 加;くわ]えたるるよ！！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#42",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_gerapato_03",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]どうやら クッパ[Ruby 城;じょう]に\n[Ruby 来;く]るつもり らしいるるが\n[Ruby 簡単;かんたん]には [Ruby 来;こ]られないるるよ。[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#43",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_gerapato_04",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:][0001:0001:]というより [Ruby 来;こ]させないるる！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#44",
   "label": "MES_EV_Mushiba_11_Mushi_11_gerapato_05",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]ふる ふる…\n[Ruby 長;なが]い[Ruby 人生;じんせい] より[Ruby 道;みち]も[Ruby 必要;ひつよう]るるよ。[0002:0001:][Next][0001:0004:]そんなに あせらないで\nワレが[Ruby 改造;かいぞう]した その[Ruby 石像;せきぞう]と\n[Ruby 遊;あそ]んでいくが いいるるよ！[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#45",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Kpump_01_koopa_01",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]あ～[0002:0000:0A 00] ハラの[Ruby 中;なか]が\nちゃぽん ちゃぽんだ。[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#46",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Kpump_01_koopa_02",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:][0001:0001:]なんだ？[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#47",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Kpump_01_koopa_03",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]なんだと？[0002:0000:0A 00]\nどうしてだ？[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#48",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Kpump_01_koopa_04",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:][0001:0001:]なに？ よごれがとれる？[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#49",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Kpump_01_koopa_05",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:]じゃあ [Ruby 体;からだ]の[Ruby 悪;わる]いところが\nなおるのか？[0002:0001:]"
  },
  {
   "id": "FMsg/o_mushiba_11#50",
   "label": "MES_Mushiba_11_Kpump_01_koopa_06",
   "style": 6,
   "attr": "00000000",
   "jp": "[0009:0000:06 00][0001:0004:][0001:0001:]ほのおも はけるようになるのか！？[0002:0001:]"
